abstract: >-
  Interoperability and FAIRness gap analysis of marine research infrastructure
  data services (Euro-Argo, ICOS, EMSO ERIC, and IFREMER) conducted within the
  Horizon Europe GEORGE project (Grant Agreement No. 101094716). Includes
  Jupyter notebooks assessing ODIS compliance, 5-Star Open Data maturity, and
  service-type interoperability across multiple data access protocols, together
  with supporting Docker-based semantic ingestion and dereferencing services.
